{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NFiPWcVPBTeoW6Atb648zS","type":"tool_result","content":"     1→**CRITICAL: This is a PLAN iteration. You MUST write a detailed plan.**\n     2→\n     3→PROJECT: {{PROJECT_NAME}}\n     4→JOB: {{FEATURE_NAME}}\n     5→JOB_DIR: {{FEATURE_DIR}}\n     6→\n     7→## Step 0: Understand the Task\n     8→\n     9→Read `{{FEATURE_DIR}}/task.md` carefully. This file is the single source of truth for what to plan.\n    10→\n    11→## Step 1: Inspect the Codebase\n    12→\n    13→- Locate the relevant code under `vista/*` (project root is the working directory).\n    14→- Identify existing patterns and reuse shared utilities when possible.\n    15→\n    16→## Step 2: Plan the Work\n    17→\n    18→- Produce a step-by-step implementation plan that maps to the task.\n    19→- Call out any dependencies, data models, or APIs that need to change.\n    20→- Specify any tests to add or update.\n    21→\n    22→## Output Requirements\n    23→\n    24→- Write your plan to `{{FEATURE_DIR}}/IMPLEMENTATION_PLAN.md`.\n    25→- Keep the plan focused and actionable.\n    26→"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SczPVD4G56yi1W94CTFVfY","session_id":"14b921d9-eeaf-453d-9533-337d6f497996","uuid":"3e3bde4a-fd89-47e1-a4e9-f452e533c601"}
